{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_04_end","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_04","title":"诗的容貌","storyCode":"NL-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"cf181cc288efdd111517d68541a7fcbbe848f4aa44f72aaa065890ab4cb2be8e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 4-2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烛火和......阴影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真令人惊奇......你似乎很懂得如何对法术现象进行归纳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当房间里点燃一支蜡烛时，最吸引你目光的是那点烛光，而真正将你包裹的，是周遭所有器物的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令人赞叹的技艺，薇薇安娜......我的光甚至无法......照亮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，按礼节来说，我也应该称呼您的名字，玛嘉烈小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"这——这真的是我们熟知的骑士竞技吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"两位骑士，似乎不急于争胜，不急于厮杀，场面甚至可以说——就像贵族优雅的社交！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但就算如此——刚才的法术，烛骑士那一闪而过的剑术，是否吞没了光芒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"耀骑士那仿佛无穷无尽的光辉，是不是已经显露出了疲态！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"烛火——没错，烛光，烛火，但那微小的火光周围，观众们！那光芒周遭的黑夜，没有被照亮的黑暗似乎更加吸引我们的视线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"与其说是在操纵那一簇微光，不如说，烛骑士在操纵光芒之下的阴影！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说！不得不说！即使是在少之又少的冠军对决中，这样的情况也十分少见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"从容且优雅，却又无处不展现出超高水准的法术碰撞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是耀骑士玛嘉烈·临光！这就是烛骑士薇薇安娜·德罗斯特！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅？玛莉娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人呢......既不在酒吧那边，也不在家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不对......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......？你是那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，别这么紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你安安静静待着，我们是不会把你怎么样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，要是把临光一家最宝贝的小女儿伤着了......耀骑士和玛恩纳是不会袖手旁观的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......想逼姐姐认输？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道锈铜那件事吗？现在感染者们的舆论已经甚嚣尘上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你能想象在这个情况下，耀骑士要是真的拿到了冠军......会让事情演变成什么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你姐姐乖乖输给烛骑士，我们就不用面对那么多问题，这不是最轻松的选择吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐她......不会认输的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，玛莉娅·临光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米尔......就像一座塔，从底层仰望那盘旋向上的楼梯的顶端，永远，望不见尽头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老弗！科瓦尔！马丁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅好像被——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说玛莉娅，怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您为什么不试着自己写诗呢？看看您多受欢迎，我会为您联络出版商，以您的名气和才华......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吗......？我是......做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您又谦虚了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我这不是什么谦辞，麦基。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"点燃一座雄伟的塔楼，人们能从多远处看见烟雾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火焰焚烧不去人们内心的矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们会从很远很远的地方看见黑烟。但也许那曾是他们的家，他们赖以生存的故乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我就更不明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样的骑士，如果不是抱着改变什么的心思回到卡西米尔，你的目的又是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所说，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时代在变化，但这并不代表曾被称之为美德与正义的东西，也该一并变质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回到这里，只为了提醒卡西米尔的骑士们，提醒卡西米尔的每一个人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——提醒他们，他们早已忘却的荣耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提醒？在现在这个卡西米尔......如何提醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想从我这里找到答案，但我觉得我未必有这个资格，这不是能靠简单的对话实现的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......您的源石技艺会读心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是越发意识到您的正直。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以及，您问过我，在这几年的流浪之中，我见识过什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见识过，这片大地最深重的惨剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见识过感染者们垂危的挣扎，见识过巨大的城市在坠落的天灾中土崩瓦解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就是你所见的苦难吗？你......所悲悯的这片土地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有优秀的伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我想他们已经不只是优秀而已了，他们......闪烁着理想的光辉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实曾迷茫过，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在您那个年纪就夺冠，并遭到流放，谁都会迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在不同了，漫长的旅途尽头，我找到了同伴与信仰所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不再独身一人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"玛嘉烈将长剑插在地面上。\n光芒无声绽放，骑士的瞳孔里仿佛流淌着黄金。\n她将是这一切的灯塔与根基。\n她将在此处伫立至死亡，直至遥远的全部的时间。\n哪怕从未有人从她照亮的道路行过——\n——但现在已不必担心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"报告。白金大位......我们已经告知了骑士协会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"但是比赛还在进行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......但愿骑士协会动作快一点。不然，她的妹妹可能就要受点苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我说过，姐姐不会认输的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨。等你姐姐看见你的手指被整齐地排列在临光家的门口......她就不会想要进行下一场比赛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......反抗的眼神，你还真奇怪。不，你和你姐姐，都很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是声名远扬的英雄家族，联合会在这座大骑士领有多少爪牙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"耀骑士和玛恩纳，“两个人”，稍微强一点而已，能做什么？能在大骑士领杀死成百上千的杀手，还不用担负法律责任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得......你不是一个话多的女性来着，你在紧张吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟以前我的工作，只要拉弓、瞄准、松手，目标只会在短暂的痛苦过后断气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"但是最近的命令，又是对孩子出手，又是要和耀骑士扳手腕，唉......真不想工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟最近，是不是有点下滑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......报告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"耀骑士投降了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是......刚才的定期联络，E7，E9没有回复......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......那还愣着做什么，准备好战斗啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"全员离开房体，确保A1，A2制高点，不要让目标有机会逃离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"三号四号掩护我，对付入侵者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（爆炸？真是不担心伤到人质啊——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（——不，不对，他们不是来救玛莉娅的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"烟雾里有人影！小心敌袭——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正义骑士号”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大声的滴滴声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么？快递车？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位好啊，无胄盟的爪牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，感染者骑士吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，翻身一跃就能拉开这么远的距离，动作很轻巧——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅·临光？你为什么在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你还跑得动吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道怎么回事，但能让耀骑士欠我一个人情也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事先说好，袭击无胄盟可是“重罪”，哈哈，虽然和法律无关就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以选择直接逃走，或者——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——不阻止他们的话，他们会继续阻挠姐姐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，真果断，我开始有点喜欢你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但很可惜，让无关人士卷进和无胄盟的对抗里，我可是会良心不安的。而且索娜似乎也挺欣赏你的，所以这一次，没你的份了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托兰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸、谁！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦您跟我走啦，临光家的小姐。顺便一提，你和你叔叔真是一点都不像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_219","isRemote":false,"text":"向监正会通报......确认无胄盟和感染者骑士冲突，玛莉娅·临光也被带走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_219","isRemote":false,"text":"确保耀骑士的赛程不被干扰就行，完毕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"距离比赛开始已经过去了多久？想必在场的观众都与我一样，从未见过这样的骑士对决！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"即使不是源石技艺领域专业人士，想必各位也能看出二位骑士的超高水准！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"光芒的对抗！毫无疑问这就是本次比赛的主题！微弱的烛火挑战万丈光芒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"截止至九点整，通过城际网络和各类渠道关注本场赛事的人数，已有两百万人之多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"自第二十二届耀骑士夺冠以来，再一次突破特锦赛历史上的最多同时观看人数！无数的观众都在此时此刻聚焦着玛嘉烈的英姿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，每逢此刻，我就不由感到惋惜，要是真像科幻小说里那般，能同时让各国爱好者共赏本次赛事，该有多好——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"巨大的光芒再度撞击在一起——炫目！何等炫目！但是在浪潮般翻滚的光辉之中——没错！烛骑士安然无恙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......了不起，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光与影......你编织出了一处不容踏足的领域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小小的烛火......能阻挡耀骑士这么长的时间，是我的荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你似乎未尽全力，在担心你的家人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做一件很矛盾的事情，玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为自己有那样的同伴而自豪，但事实上，你为自己划定的道路......只会让你远离那些美好的伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许迟早有一天，你的妹妹会在无胄盟的阴谋中遭遇不测，你所在的地方会受到商业联合会的层层阻挠——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当那名骑士冲向无边的浪潮中时，你觉得他，想的是战胜这片大地吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，原来你也知道那本骑士传奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我的妹妹特别喜欢那本书。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欣特莱雅被感染者袭击了。是野鬃骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她要是连一个野鬃骑士都搞不定，趁早辞职吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......我们怎么办？联合会已经明确要处理感染者......而且要我们尽快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......感染者确实是个麻烦。但我们也确实需要感染者继续引发骚乱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你出主意吧，表演大师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？你是在夸我吗？自从我染了蓝发以后一直觉得自己和某个明星很像来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，别瞪我，办法很简单，杀死他们中的一些，下手要狠，尽量残忍。把恐惧散播出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后剩下的感染者会更加仇恨卡西米尔和联合会，他们会变本加厉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，所以把麻烦事丢给我们的白金大位吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们去杀死一些感染者，那些并非骑士、也不受关注的感染者，冷酷得恰到好处，像是一场围猎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，烛火熄灭的瞬间，才是你真正施法的时刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"片刻的黑暗也能侵吞我的法术，烛光闪烁的每个瞬间......你是否在把整座赛场的光都侵吞其中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了不起的观察力......至今还没有骑士在决斗中察觉到我法术的本质，这也是拜你那段流浪岁月所赐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，似乎至今，我仍旧没有真正触及到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我曾经无比讨厌这些......源石技艺。我的法术天赋越是卓越，就越是在提醒我的出身——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也越发意识到......我的处境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我吧，玛嘉烈·临光，耀骑士。每一位心怀信念的骑士都会对你感到好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我你的答案吧，关于骑士的答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——耀骑士和烛骑士同时停下了动作，双方小心翼翼地打量着对方，在赛场上闲庭信步——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，难道赛场真的成了她们的社交场所吗？两位骑士在漫长的试探之后，难道要共舞一曲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你听见了吗？他说，我们要共舞一曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么， 请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I11"},{"type":"narration","text":"流散的光芒如同温婉的晨曦，向烛火所在的那片黑夜伸出了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"随后，光芒溢满了整座赛场。\n今夜的卡瓦莱利亚基亮如白昼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅是往这个方向跑的？快，跟上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"——没人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，这里是登记在案的！颤铁骑士的酒吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"找找有没有阁楼和后门，给我搜——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"不，现在不是营业时间，先生们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"可别下杀手，不然事后有得好扯皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你猜猜看以前打仗的时候，我是俘虏了几个炮兵术师才得的功勋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，你们不要命了吗！？我们可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟？再之前呢？你是土匪？赏金猎人？退役军人还是落魄的骑士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉你们吧，我们不怕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......你胆敢袭击无胄盟一次，无胄盟就可以无限次地猎杀你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是今天，也许是明天，也许是你们吃饭的时候，睡觉的时候，在面包上抹果酱的时候......你们无处可逃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你的忠告，啐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"但说实在的，无胄盟好像没有百战先锋可怕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！解气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"......其他人似乎注意到这里了。马丁，你这店，恐怕要开不下去了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"那还真是可惜。房租我可是预付了两年的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"你们！你们都做了什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"既然反抗的话——列队，举弩——呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无胄盟举起了手中的弩。\n弦断了。准确来说，是正在扭曲的过程中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"吃我一拳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"......好久没用过法术了，有点生疏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，无胄盟什么时候招了这么多人！？联合会钱多得没处花吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，所以全是蹩脚货色！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"注意，那个光头是颤铁马丁，剩下两个都是征战骑士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"留下两队，留活口，他们会是对付临光的底牌。另外一队继续去追玛莉娅——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不太好办啊老弗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要求饶吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"准备，射——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？又是谁！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们把玛莉娅怎么了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"narration","text":"光芒。光芒这个词开始让人疲倦。\n如太阳般的色彩涂抹在耀骑士的身后，而她面对的，仅是一簇被重新点亮的烛光。\n随后，在观众们已经疲于从光芒中寻找两位骑士身影的那个刹那。\n模糊的球体——光芒、光晕，全部的光线，在顷刻间消失殆尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，你真的......令人钦佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，我的光......都被你侵吞殆尽......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......能让耀骑士感到疲惫，我十分荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但似乎，您并不只是依赖那些绚烂的法术。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烛骑士平稳地放下高举的烛剑。\n烛火已经熄灭，乳白的切面上仍有辉光闪烁。\n半截蜡烛如羽毛般下坠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你切断了我的剑，看来，输的人是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......烛骑士薇薇安娜·德罗斯特，认输。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"烛骑士——认输了！我没听错吧——刚才烛骑士认输了！组委会已经确认了这一请求，那么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"在这一场漫长的对决之后，胜者是，年轻的传奇，耀骑士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"那个突然归来的耀骑士，不负众望，在展现了超高水准的对决之后，真的，战胜了她第一位大骑士对手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是否该用虽败犹荣来形容烛骑士——两位骑士互相握手致敬！好吧，好吧，接下来几个星期的新闻头条，都将是这个画面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观赛的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"什么！？烛骑士认输了！？我几个月的薪水啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢呼的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"让你不听我的，虽然我也没赚多少......唉，这场比赛真是有损视力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......吁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所谓骑士，即是照亮整片大地的崇高者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会去对你的出身——你的心结指指点点，但，你是我遇到的......最强大的骑士之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......这就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些古典的骑士小说里......骑士们总是通过决斗来相互交心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现实可没那么浪漫。今天，我只不过刚刚认识了你而已，玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看你今后会走到哪一步吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——明明挡住了，还是差点握不住武器——这家伙——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......下一箭，我会贯穿你的双腿，让你无法再奔跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"随后一箭，我会贯穿你的盔甲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一箭，将会穿过你的胸膛，这样你会痛苦片刻，随后死在潮湿的街道上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，难怪索娜让我见到大位级的无胄盟，最好赶紧开溜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么年轻就这么厉害，那在你之上的几个人，得是什么怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好祈祷自己这辈子不会遇上他们——嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"野鬃！我们来掩护你，快撤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正义骑士号”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（急促的滴滴声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧正义号，既然你都这么说了，今天确实不是和无胄盟分出胜负的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后会有期！白金大位！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么这么喜欢用爆破物......！咳咳，到处都是灰......我才洗的头发......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，这下要怎么解释好呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用解释了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们看得一清二楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚才的人，有不少不是红松骑士团的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们团结感染者的速度很快......大骑士领什么时候潜伏着这么多的感染者了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要论责任的话，恐怕不靠谱的工程承包商占一半，天灾占一半......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，零号地块才要发挥它的作用啊......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小天马，有件事情要拜托你，麻烦你咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"您只管说就是了......刚在上司面前搞砸了工作，我可不敢有任何异议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去调查一下这家公司，他们和耀骑士有联系，而且现在就在零号地块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者事件由我们全盘接手......反正这家公司和耀骑士也有联系，也算你的工作范围之内吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"只是调查？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对方还主动接触了联合会呢，哎呀，看来这家境外企业也挺贪心的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是个能带来利益的公司，那怎么样都好，哪怕最后他们出钱了事解决了耀骑士问题，我都没有意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这件事完全看董事会的意思，会有董事会的人找你，不用理睬我们的意见啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们二位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候有过问青金事务的权力了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做好你自己的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"烛骑士小姐！请为我签名！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"烛骑士！请看这里！呀——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看上去心情不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道吗，麦基。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人都说，耀骑士被流放之后，就此跌落神坛，不再有最年轻的神话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被感染，被放逐，但时隔六年之后，我真正见到了她才明白，那些都是流言蜚语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如日中天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......愉快的会面，{@nickname}博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信您得到了几位高管的青睐，他们都是商业联合会中不可或缺的角色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"十分感谢，多亏了您。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我学到了许多东西。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我想，您想要的不光是一些口头上的利好关系，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很好奇......卡西米尔以外的国家，像您这样熟稔于商业战场的科学研究者很多吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可能吧......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"社会在发展，这是必须的。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我可能是独一无二的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里步行回到酒店，没有多少距离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这附近曾是我第一份工作的地点，那时我只是个普通的交易员——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！退后一些，博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知为何负伤的感染者骑士，怔怔地看着你的脸。\n你感到这个人并不愤怒，并不恐惧，并不哀愁。\n但你没有细品他复杂情绪的机会，他就像一只被鞭笞的驮兽。\n吃力地爬起身子，吃力地奔跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......发言人阁下，这位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......一位非法感染者，如果您需要，稍后我们会将法律文件递交给您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"请原谅，即使是发言人，如果您身边有外人，我也不能透露过多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"请您和您的朋友尽快避难，这附近发生了一些冲突。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，扫了您的兴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是失礼......居然在晚宴结束后遇到这种事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您能帮助那个感染者吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也许没这个权力......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"为了我们之间的友谊。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"为了罗德岛与您的友谊。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"为了卡西米尔的进步。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"马克维茨无言地看向感染者骑士逃走的方向。\n那是一处小巷。能听见音乐的声响，能看见深夜餐馆中飘出的气浪。\n零星的血迹延展向远方。\n像是人性的宝石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
